            <Data ss:Type="String">#TOOLTIP_AVATAR_Doom</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">[c=1,1,0.5]地震·罗伯博士[/c]</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Quake is the name of the doctor, based on Dr. Doom, the marvel supervillan. The joke is that Quake and Doom are similar video games.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">[c=1,1,0.5]Dr. Quake Robe[/c]</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#TOOLTIP_AVATAR_DoomD</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">“人们说他在某处有个小村庄。”&#10;—碎嘴的学者。&#10;- 右手地震手套&#10;- 左手地震手套&#10;- 容易受到闪电伤害&#10;- 对物理，火焰和生命有抗性</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">"He owns a small coutntry somewhere" is a reference to Dr. Doom, who actually does own a small country.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">"They say he owns a minor country somewhere." -- Gossiping scholar. - Right hand Quake Glove - Left hand Quake glove - Vulnerable to Lightning - Resistance to Physical, Fire and Life</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#TOOLTIP_AVATAR_horrible</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">[c=1,1,0.5]糟糕·罗伯博士[/c]</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Terrible is used instead of Horrible. Based on the character Dr. Horrible, from the movie Dr. Horrible's sing along blog.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">[c=1,1,0.5]Dr. Terrible Robe[/c]</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#TOOLTIP_AVATAR_horribleD</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">“那是新的流行语吗？” &#10;—无名的水系巫师。&#10;- 死亡射线&#10;- 物质转化射线&#10;- 在糟糕学上获得了博士学位。&#10;- 容易受到物理伤害&#10;- 对元素伤害抗性提升</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">It is a joke on Dr. Horrible's catchphrase "I have a PhD in Horribleness!" and his friends following reply.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">"Is that the new catchphrase?"  -- Anonymous water-casting wizard. - Death Ray - Trans-matter Ray - Has a PhD in terribleness. - Vulnerable to Physical damage - Increased resistance to the elements</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#TOOLTIP_AVATAR_who</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">[c=1,1,0.5]不知道是哪个罗伯博士[/c]</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Named as such because it will sound like "Witch doctor". Based on Doctor Who, another doctor with an interrogative name.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">[c=1,1,0.5]Which Dr. Robe[/c]</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
